            <ArticleTitle>Epidural fentanyl and monoamine oxidase inhibitors.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>210-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The successful use of continuous epidural fentanyl infusion to control postoperative pain in a patient treated with monoamine oxidase inhibitors is described. The use of epidural opioids may be a safe technique for the management of such patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
